<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/bml https://blockml.org/schemas/bml.xsd
                      "
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:type="org.blockml.bml.type">

  <name>InstanceIdentifierEntity</name>
  <type>type:InstanceIdentifierEntity</type>
  <baseType>core:PrimitiveEntity(type:InstanceIdentifier)</baseType>
  <is>A Block instance name as an Entity</is>

  <documentation>Concrete Entity wrapping an InstanceIdentifier primitive. Binds T =
    InstanceIdentifier on org.blockml.bml.core.PrimitiveEntity via baseType — inherits the value
    property automatically. Use when an instance name that need not exist must appear as an
    identifiable Block instance. Existence-checked counterparts use InstanceReferenceEntity.</documentation>
</block>
